                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cafcdd44-8db3-3206-aa0d-c0a86d2db775",
                        "entry_id": "7c8b8791-723b-3a8a-9f0d-a1860ee5aed3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "lightning"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8690c40-dffd-4f7d-a9ff-d861eab69140",
                                "sense_id": "cafcdd44-8db3-3206-aa0d-c0a86d2db775",
                                "text": "Э́то бы́ло как при бле́ске молоньи́ среди́ тёмной но́чи, когда́ почему́-то вдруг ви́дишь чрезвыча́йное мно́жество предме́тов зараз: за́навес крова́ти, ши́рму, окно́, вздро́гнувшую на жёрдочке канаре́йку и стака́н с сере́бряной ло́жечкой, на ру́чке кото́рой пя́тнышками осе́ла магне́зия.",
                                "translation": "It was like a flash of lightning amidst the dark of night, when for some reason you suddenly see an extraordinary multitude of things at once: the bed canopy, the folding screen, the window, the canary fluttering on its perch, and a glass with a silver spoon in it and spots of magnesium on its handle.",
                                "english": "It was like a flash of lightning amidst the dark of night, when for some reason you suddenly see an extraordinary multitude of things at once: the bed canopy, the folding screen, the window, the canary fluttering on its perch, and a glass with a silver spoon in it and spots of magnesium on its handle."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
